AltoMarket::RemoveCollateral()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when assets is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when onBehalf is zero address
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when sender is not authorized
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when data is provided but receiver is not authorized
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when position becomes insolvent after removal
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when all conditions are met
        ├── it should accrue interest and emit AccrueInterest event
        ├── it should remove collateral from position
        ├── it should transfer collateral tokens to receiver
        ├── when callback data is provided and receiver is authorized
        │   └── it should call onRemoveCollateralCallback
        ├── it should emit RemoveCollateral event
        └── it should return the amount of assets removed